{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14702","headline":"闲居寄薛华 · 于良史","name":"闲居寄薛华","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隐几读黄老，闲居耳目清。\n僻居人事少，多病道心生。\n雨洗山林湿，鸦鸣池馆晴。\n晚来因废卷，行药至西城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于良史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14702.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14702","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}